        "en": "Pet owners frequently praise the clinic's staff, from front desk coordinators and security personnel to veterinary technicians and doctors, for their warmth and patience. Reviewers emphasize how welcoming and dedicated the team is during appointments. However, several visitors experienced difficulties with communication or felt unassisted when seeking help for community animals."
