      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently point out the gentle and caring treatment their pets receive throughout their visits. Clients note that dogs, cats, and rescue animals are handled with empathy and reassurance, helping keep nervous pets calm during routine exams, vaccinations, and surgical check-ins. Almost all feedback reflects strong trust in how staff treat each animal."
      }
